    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a futuristic facility where trauma is treated using memory-editing technology, you enter the mind of a child to provide therapy. But soon, you realize you\u2019re not alone. Creatures inhabit this strange world, and survival becomes your only goal.<br>In the open-world survival game <strong>Trauma-Island</strong>, avoid hostile creatures, craft tools and buildings, and collect memory fragments to heal the trauma within.</p>",
